  "testId": "testClasses.webstore.productListingPage.ProductListingPageTest#verifyFacetsFilter",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "On the Tools PLP (page size 64), applies a Brand facet value and checks the filtered count, removes it (64 products again), collapses the Brand group and checks a Power Type facet value.",
    "steps": [
      "Open Tools from the menu, page size 64",
      "Select the brand facet value, verify the filtered product count",
      "Unselect it, verify 64 products",
      "Collapse the Brand facet group, expand Power Type, verify the Power Type value",
      "Grid view, collapse Power Type, Brand facet expander visible"
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "category",
      "category_facets"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "None"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Filtered product count equals the facet count",
      "64 products after removing the filter",
      "Power Type value present"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Independent method. Tools PLP: every method that opens Tools from the menu (independent methods, no dependsOn) declares its own tools = CATEGORY_WITH_PRODUCTS {store, minProducts 65, minSubcategories 3, topLevel true}, preferred the sheet label (homePage!B16 'Tools' = CategoryCode Tools), with identical params in every method so normal and fallback runs resolve the same category. minProducts 65: the 64 page size must fill and the sort checks read a second page (verifyListIsInZToAOrder clicks the right arrow).",
      "toolsFacets = CATEGORY_FACET_VALUES {store, categoryId @tools.categoryId, attributeCodes Brand,CordlessCorded, minValuesPerAttribute 1, minProductsForValue 1, maxProductsForValue 64}: CordlessCorded is the 'Power Type' attribute (PimAttributeId 140, Simple Select); its title is fixed in the locator constant BEFORE_XPATH_POWER_TYPE_FACET_FILTER (config). The filtered count must fit the 64 page.",
      "Sheet values: brandName 'Speedaire' -> toolsFacets.facet1Value1Label, Brand 'Brand' (facet group title) -> toolsFacets.facet1Label, PowerType 'Battery' -> toolsFacets.facet2Value1Label; page size 64 config.",
      "Store: openWebstoreUrl opens automation_webStoreUrl (atstage: webstore-z10-atstage, the main store MaxwellsHardware), the same store as the Selenium pdp/quickOrder entries.",
      "Profile: work/profiles/profile.json has no observations for these Selenium cells (profiled false); DB facts from bin/tda rows (2026-11-10) where cited.",
      "Scanned constant values (locators, report messages, map key prefixes, regex) are framework constants: role config, no need.",
      "migrate: Selenium reads Excel tables through TestData.getMap / getHashMap; there is no swap for Selenium."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "CATEGORY_WITH_PRODUCTS",
      "alias": "tools",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "minProducts": 65,
        "minSubcategories": 3,
        "topLevel": true
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 3,
        "required": false
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "CATEGORY_FACET_VALUES",
      "alias": "toolsFacets",
      "params": {
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "categoryId": "@tools.categoryId",
        "attributeCodes": "Brand,CordlessCorded",
        "minValuesPerAttribute": 1,
        "minProductsForValue": 1,
        "maxProductsForValue": 64
      }
    }
  ],
  "linkedCases": [
